// 閸氬矁鐭剧悰灞芥倵缁旑垱鏆熼幑顔肩氨閸╄櫣鍤庨敍鍦stgreSQL閿?
// 鐎瑰綊鍣虹憴鍕灟閿涙瓖rip.capacity 閸欘亣鍏橀弰?3 閹?4閿涘奔绗栭幀璁虫眽閺佹澘鎯堥崣鎴濆礋娴滄亽鈧?
// Prisma schema 閺冪姵纭剁悰銊ㄦ彧 CHECK 缁撅附娼敍?|4閵嗕胶濮搁幀?鐟欐帟澹?鐢厺缍呴崪灞惧腹閼芥劗鎮婇悽杈ㄧ墡妤?
// 閸︺劌绨查悽銊ョ湴娑?prisma/migrations/20260824190000_trip_domain_checks 娑擃厼鍙￠崥灞藉繁閸掕翰鈧?

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

model User {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  phone           String?  @unique
  phoneVerified   Boolean  @default(false) // 閺堫亜鐣幋鎰閺堝搫褰挎宀冪槈閸欘亣鍏樺ù蹇氼潔
  studentVerified Boolean  @default(false) // 鐎涳妇鏁撶拋銈堢槈娴犲懍淇婃禒缁樼垼缁涙拝绱濇稉宥嗗閹?
  nickname        String?
  gender          String?
  creditScore     Int      @default(100)
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  createdTrips  Trip[]             @relation("TripCreator")
  memberships   TripMember[]
  confirmations TripConfirmation[]
  sessions      Session[]
  chatMessages  ChatMessage[]
  farePlanDecisions FarePlanChangeDecision[]

  @@map("users")
}

model Trip {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  creatorId   String
  creator     User     @relation("TripCreator", fields: [creatorId], references: [id])
  origin      String
  destination String
  departTime  DateTime
  capacity    Int // 閸欘亜鍘戠拋?3 閹?4閿涘本鈧姹夐弫鏉挎儓閸欐垵宕熸禍鐚寸幢鎼存梻鏁ょ仦?+ SQL CHECK 瀵搫鍩?
  feePlan     Json? // 闁叉垿顤傛稉鈧瀣殻閺佹澘鍨?
  femaleOnly  Boolean  @default(false)
  status      String   @default("RECRUITING") // 閹锋稑瀚欐稉?閳?閸欏苯鎮滅涵顔款吇娑?閳?瀹稿弶鍨氶崶?閳?瀵板懎褰ㄦ潪?閳?瀹告彃褰ㄦ潪?閳?鐞涘瞼鈻肩紒鎾存将瀵板懐绮ㄧ粻?閳?缂佹挾鐣荤€瑰本鍨?閳?瀵板懓鐦庢禒?閳?瀹告彃缍婂?
  version     Int      @default(0) // 娑旀劘顫囬柨渚婄礉閻樿埖鈧礁褰夐弴鏉戠箑妞ょ粯鐗庢?
  disputeLocked Boolean @default(false)
  createRequestKey String? @unique
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  members         TripMember[]
  confirmations   TripConfirmation[]
  recommendations RecommendationDecision[]
  rideRecords     RideRecord[]
  vehicleUpdates  VehicleUpdate[]
  fareOrders      FareOrder[]
  sosEvents       SosEvent[]
  reviews         Review[]
  reports         Report[]
  chatMessages    ChatMessage[]
  objectUploads   ObjectUpload[]
  farePlanRevisions FarePlanRevision[]
  farePlanChangeRequests FarePlanChangeRequest[]

  @@index([departTime]) // 閸掓銆冮幐?depart_time ASC
  @@map("trips")
}

model ObjectUpload {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid())
  purpose         String
  provider        String
  objectKey       String    @unique @map("object_key")
  tripId          String    @map("trip_id")
  trip            Trip      @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  ownerId         String    @map("owner_id")
  allowedMimeType String    @map("allowed_mime_type")
  declaredSizeBytes Int     @map("declared_size_bytes")
  maxSizeBytes    Int       @map("max_size_bytes")
  requestKey      String    @unique @map("request_key")
  expiresAt       DateTime  @map("expires_at")
  claimedAt       DateTime? @map("claimed_at")
  deletedAt       DateTime? @map("deleted_at")
  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@index([expiresAt, claimedAt, deletedAt])
  @@map("object_uploads")
}

model TripMember {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId      String
  trip        Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  userId      String
  user        User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  role        String   @default("MEMBER") // CREATOR | MEMBER
  memberCount Int      @default(1) // 鐠囥儲鍨氶崨妯哄窗閻劌楠囨担宥嗘殶閿涙艾褰傞崡鏇氭眽=1閿涘苯濮為崗銉ㄢ偓?1 閹?2
  joinRequestKey String? @unique // 鐎广垺鍩涚粩顖濐嚞濮瑰倸绠撶粵澶愭暛
  joinedAt    DateTime @default(now())

  confirmations TripConfirmation[]

  @@unique([tripId, userId]) // 楠炲倻鐡戦敍姘倱娑撯偓閻劍鍩涢崷銊ユ倱娑撯偓鐞涘瞼鈻奸崣顏呮箒娑撯偓閺夆剝鍨氶崨妯款唶瑜?
  @@index([tripId, joinRequestKey])
  @@map("trip_members")
}

model TripConfirmation {
  id             String      @id @default(uuid())
  tripId         String
  trip           Trip        @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  memberId       String
  member         TripMember  @relation(fields: [memberId], references: [id])
  userId         String
  user           User        @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  status         String      @default("CONFIRMED") // CONFIRMED | VOID閿涘牆娲栭柅鈧担婊冪熬閿涘绱眜serId 閸愭ぞ缍戠€涙顔岃箛鍛淬€忔稉?member.userId 娑撯偓閼?
  confirmedAt    DateTime    @default(now())
  retractUntil   DateTime? // 閺堚偓閸氬簼绔撮崥宥嗗灇閸涙鈥樼拋銈呯磻閸氼垳娈?15 缁夋帒寮介幃鏃傜崶閸?
  idempotencyKey String?     @unique // 闁插秴顦茬涵顔款吇楠炲倻鐡?
  createdAt      DateTime    @default(now())

  @@map("trip_confirmations")
}

model RecommendationDecision {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId    String
  trip      Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  reasons   String[] // SQL CHECK 瀵搫鍩楅惂钘夋倳閸楁洩绱癟IME_CLOSE | RELIABLE | VERIFIED | OPEN_SLOT閿涘本娓舵径?3 娑擃亷绱濇稉宥呭閸濆秵甯撴惔?
  decidedAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@map("recommendation_decisions")
}

model AuditLog {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId    String?
  actorId   String?
  action    String // confirm | form-group | withdraw | rollback | duplicate-request 缁?
  payload   Json?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([tripId])
  @@map("audit_logs")
}

model RideRecord {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId      String
  trip        Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  requestedBy String
  platform    String
  mode        String   @default("MANUAL_FALLBACK")
  status      String   @default("WAITING_RIDE")
  requestKey   String?  @unique
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  @@index([tripId])
}

model VehicleUpdate {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId    String
  trip      Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  updatedBy String
  requestKey String? @unique
  plate     String
  model     String?
  color     String?
  platform  String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  @@index([tripId])
}

model FareOrder {
  id                   String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId               String   @unique
  trip                 Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  submittedBy          String
  totalAmountCents     Int
  screenshotKey        String
  screenshotMimeType   String
  screenshotSizeBytes  Int
  status               String   @default("PENDING_CONFIRMATION") // PENDING_CONFIRMATION | CONFIRMED | DISPUTED | MANUAL_REVIEW
  createdAt            DateTime @default(now())
  confirmedAt          DateTime?
  // 阶段 3：截图留存。确认后设 90 天后删除，争议时清空，结案后从 resolvedAt 重计。
  retentionDeleteAfter DateTime?
  screenshotDeletedAt  DateTime?
  updatedAt            DateTime @updatedAt
  requestKey           String?  @unique @map("request_key")
  sourceUploadId       String?  @unique @map("source_upload_id")
  disputes             FareDispute[]
  confirmations        FareOrderConfirmation[]
  paymentMarks         PaymentMark[]
  @@index([status])
}

model FareDispute {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  fareOrderId String
  fareOrder   FareOrder @relation(fields: [fareOrderId], references: [id])
  raisedBy    String
  reason      String
  status      String   @default("OPEN")
  // 阶段 3：争议结案时间，用于截图留存重计时。
  resolvedAt  DateTime?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
}

model FareOrderConfirmation {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  fareOrderId String
  fareOrder   FareOrder @relation(fields: [fareOrderId], references: [id])
  userId      String
  confirmedAt DateTime @default(now())
  @@unique([fareOrderId, userId])
}

model PaymentMark {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  fareOrderId String
  fareOrder   FareOrder @relation(fields: [fareOrderId], references: [id])
  userId      String
  amountCents Int?
  status      String   @default("MARKED")
  markedAt    DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt
  @@unique([fareOrderId, userId])
}

model EmergencyContact {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId    String
  name      String
  phone     String
  active    Boolean  @default(true)
  requestKey String? @unique
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  @@index([userId])
}

model SosEvent {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId    String
  userId    String
  latitude  Float?
  longitude Float?
  note      String?
  requestKey String? @unique
  status    String   @default("RECORDED")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  trip      Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  @@index([tripId])
}

model NotificationEvent {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  type      String
  tripId    String?
  userId    String?
  payload   Json
  status    String   @default("PENDING")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  @@index([tripId])
}

model Review {
  id            String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId        String
  trip          Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  reviewerId    String
  targetUserId  String
  punctuality   Int
  safety        Int
  politeness    Int
  communication Int
  comment       String?
  anonymous     Boolean  @default(false)
  requestKey    String?  @unique
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  @@unique([tripId, reviewerId, targetUserId])
}

model Report {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId       String?
  trip          Trip?   @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  reporterId    String
  targetUserId  String?
  type          String
  description   String
  evidenceKey   String?
  status        String   @default("OPEN")
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  @@index([tripId])
}

model AnalyticsEvent {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId       String?
  eventKey     String
  eventType    String
  tripId       String?
  reasonCodes  String[]
  ruleVersion  String
  payload      Json
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
  @@unique([eventKey])
  @@index([tripId])
}

model SmsCode {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  phone        String
  code         String
  status       String    @default("PENDING")
  requestIp    String?
  attemptCount Int       @default(0)
  expiresAt    DateTime
  consumedAt   DateTime?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())

  @@index([phone])
  @@index([phone, status])
  @@map("sms_codes")
}

model Session {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  token     String   @unique
  ipAddress String?
  userAgent String?
  expiresAt DateTime
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([userId])
  @@map("sessions")
}

model ChatMessage {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId      String
  trip        Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  senderId    String
  sender      User     @relation(fields: [senderId], references: [id])
  kind        String   @default("TEXT") // TEXT | CONFIRMATION_CARD
  text        String   @db.VarChar(500) // 鏂囨湰闀垮害涓婇檺锛岄槻姝㈣秴闀挎秷鎭?
  payload     Json? // 缁撴瀯鍖栫‘璁ゅ崱鐗囩瓑闄勫姞鏁版嵁
  clientKey   String? // 瀹㈡埛绔箓绛夐敭锛岄噸澶嶅彂閫佽繑鍥為娆＄粨鏋?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([tripId, clientKey]) // 骞傜瓑锛氬悓涓€琛岀▼鍐呭悓涓€瀹㈡埛绔敭鍙惤涓€鏉?
  @@index([tripId, createdAt]) // 鍘嗗彶娑堟伅鎸夋椂闂村垎椤?
  @@map("chat_messages")
}

/// 阶段 2：成团后费用分摊修订。每次方案变更产生新 revision，旧 revision 标记 SUPERSEDED。
model FarePlanRevision {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId      String
  trip        Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  mode        String   // EQUAL | FIXED | CUSTOM
  allocations Json?    // CUSTOM 模式下 { userId: percentage }，总和必须 100
  amountCents Int?     // FIXED 模式下的固定金额（整数分）
  status      String   @default("PENDING_CONFIRMATION") // PENDING_CONFIRMATION | CONFIRMED | SUPERSEDED
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  confirmations   FarePlanConfirmation[]
  changeRequests   FarePlanChangeRequest[]

  @@index([tripId])
  @@map("fare_plan_revisions")
}

/// 方案确认：每个成员对某 revision 的确认记录，成团后全员确认才锁定。
model FarePlanConfirmation {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  revisionId  String
  revision    FarePlanRevision @relation(fields: [revisionId], references: [id])
  userId      String
  confirmedAt DateTime @default(now())
  requestKey  String?  @unique // 幂等键

  @@unique([revisionId, userId])
  @@map("fare_plan_confirmations")
}

/// 变更申请：发单人发起，全体成员表决。任一拒绝则申请失效，旧方案不变。
model FarePlanChangeRequest {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  tripId          String
  trip            Trip     @relation(fields: [tripId], references: [id])
  revisionId      String
  revision        FarePlanRevision @relation(fields: [revisionId], references: [id])
  requestedBy     String
  status          String   @default("PENDING") // PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED | EXPIRED
  expiresAt       DateTime // 24 小时后过期
  requestKey      String?  @unique
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  decisions       FarePlanChangeDecision[]

  @@index([tripId])
  @@map("fare_plan_change_requests")
}

/// 变更决策：每个成员对变更申请的批准或拒绝。
model FarePlanChangeDecision {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  changeRequestId String
  changeRequest   FarePlanChangeRequest @relation(fields: [changeRequestId], references: [id])
  userId          String
  user            User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  decision        String   // APPROVED | REJECTED
  requestKey      String?  @unique
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([changeRequestId, userId])
  @@map("fare_plan_change_decisions")
}